了出来，只有她，慢慢的融入金光之中。金光刺得莫忆儿睁不开眼睛，她只觉自己的身体正在快速坠落着，可她一万分的肯定，自己不会摔死！而且，她兴奋的很，这一天，她终于等到了。不知道过了多久，她的脚终于踩到了软软的土地，金光也消失了，她缓缓的睁开眼睛，忍不住兴奋的大叫：“哇！好葱绿的树林，哇！好青翠的小草，哇！好鲜艳的花朵，我敢肯定，这里一定是古代！”莫忆儿忍不住兴奋的转了个圈圈，粉红色的睡裙画了个圆弧，然后垂落在膝盖上，睡裙上面的卡通图案阿狸也似乎欢快了许多。兴奋过后，莫忆儿踏着软软的草地前行，她需要找个人，确定一下自己穿到了哪里，是成了什么千金小姐，还是农村的种田娃！不过，很快她就发现了一件事情，她是体穿的，并不是魂穿。这就难办了，没有身份，她吃啥喝啥？难道还要如同前世一样自食其力吗？其实自食其力也没什么不好，只不过，能不能不再像孤儿一样，没娘疼，没爹爱的？唉！莫忆儿忽然间有点悲伤，体穿的娃肯定没亲人了。“啊……唔唔唔！啊……唔唔唔！”不远处响起电影里面人猿泰山般的吼声，莫忆儿微怔，随之进入视野之中的竟是一只硕大的猪！确切的说，应该是野猪！野猪正疯狂的朝着莫忆儿奔来，它身体健硕，足有五六个成年男人那么大，身体黝黑，长长的毛披散着，上面还有脏脏的泥巴！莫忆儿霎那间吓傻在当场，脑子里面一片空白。“啊……唔唔唔！啊……唔唔唔！”吼声越来越近，而野猪狂奔的速度也在飙升，眼看着野猪尖利的獠牙就要刺入莫忆儿的身体，一个人飞了过来，抱着莫忆儿腾空，然后落在一棵大树上。风急速扫过皮肤，才让莫忆儿回过神来，没看清救她那人的模样，那人又飞了出去。莫忆儿眼中开始冒光：“天啊，刚刚穿越过来就看到会轻功的高手了。”不过，仅仅一秒钟之后，莫忆儿就弄清楚了面前的人为什么会飞。与其说飞，还不如说是荡，那远去的黑影手里拉着长长的树藤，像人猿泰山一样在通天的古树之中飞荡。而黑影的目标就是刚刚差点杀死莫忆儿的野猪，莫忆儿此刻心中很纠结，难道刚刚那个人是猎户？在森林里面打野猪的？在树上站了一会儿，她觉得有些累，于是改坐在树上。树木很高，现在的她离地面大概有四五米之高。该死！白痴如莫忆儿，她才想起来自己不会爬树，要是刚刚那个救她的人不回来，她要怎么下去才好？“喂！有人吗？喂！”莫忆儿又等了一会儿，终于忍不住，大声的呼救起来。“喂！有人吗？谁来救救我！”回应她的，只有忽忽的风声。刚刚的人已经荡远，根本连影子都看不到半个。莫忆儿这时候才知道有一个词叫做害怕，之前的兴奋完全被冲淡，她开始考虑自己现在的处境。不会爬树是一个难关，稍不小心掉下去就会摔死或者摔残。要是不下去，她会饿死。就算她能安全的下去，下面一定还有别的动物，野猪都那么大，万一碰上狼怎么办？这到底是什么鬼地方啊？看了看手腕上的卡通手表，时间已经过了一个多小时，莫忆儿越来越躁动不安了，终于，那人猿泰山般的吼声又响了起来。“啊……唔唔唔！啊……唔唔唔！”莫忆儿连忙呼救：“喂！救救我，我下不去了！”那人从远处荡着回来，身上还扛着什么，待到近前，莫忆儿才发现，这是一个光**上身的男人，长长的头发披在肩头，腰间似乎围着一块豹纹皮。yy中：难道豹纹从古代就开始流行了？“喂，公子，救救我！大哥？壮士？侠士……”莫忆儿边喊，边揣测着叫这个男人，男人似乎没有停下的意思，听到了莫忆儿的叫声，才在她不远处的树上停下来，疑惑的看着她。“壮士……你救救我！”莫忆儿迟疑的对男人喊，现在已经清清楚楚的看清了男人身上扛着的东西，就是刚刚的野猪。天啊，这么大的野猪他竟然能打死，而且还能扛着它在树上荡来荡去？这简直就是奇迹！男人盯着莫忆儿看，眼中满是疑惑：“！@#！@￥@#%￥……%&%……”莫忆儿也有些傻眼，这是什么国的语言？她竟然从来没听过！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 I have been looking forward to time travel for a long time. I have read one hundred and eighty time travel novels, and I feel all kinds of envy, jealousy, and hatred towards the heroines in them. The Shenma Queen, the princess, the general's wife, the princess, etc. simply fascinate Mo Yi'er. No matter how bad it is, if you cross over to farm and do business, you will end up as a rich man and a landlord. As an office worker in a second-tier city, Mo Yi'er's biggest interest is that she can travel through time and do things that make her feel awesome. Mo Yi'er's original name was not Mo Yi'er, but Mo Jinying. She had a sister named Mo Jinran (see \"Four Husbands Fighting for Favor: All Husbands Are Alluring\" for details). She disappeared a year ago, and since then she changed her name to Yi to remember and commemorate her sister. Her sister Mo Jinran is missing, and Mo Jinying is not sad, because in her heart, her sister must not be dead, but has traveled through time to enjoy happiness in some ancient time! The sisters were orphans and had lived a hard life since they were little. She felt that her sister would never suffer again in the future. She just misses her sister and hopes to meet her again one day... The huge thunder sounded in the middle of the night, waking up Mo Yi'er who was sleeping soundly. She whispered: \"It's going to rain again!\" Then she turned over and continued to sleep. But the roar was not thunder, and was followed by violent shaking. Mo Yi'er opened her eyes suddenly and saw that the whole world was being turned upside down. Suddenly, a large crack opened in the ground beside the bed, and a dazzling golden light came out. \"My dear, am I finally going to travel through time?\" Mo Yi'er's body unconsciously rolled towards the crack that glowed with golden light, rolling in with her pillow. But the pillow was bounced out by the golden light, and she was the only one, slowly integrating into the golden light. The golden light pierced Mo Yi'er so hard that she couldn't open her eyes. She felt that her body was falling rapidly, but she was absolutely certain that she would not fall to death! Moreover, she was very excited. This day was finally here. I don't know how long it took, but her feet finally touched the soft ground, and the golden light disappeared. She slowly opened her eyes, and couldn't help shouting excitedly: \"Wow! Such a green forest, wow! Such green grass, wow! Such bright flowers, I'm sure this must be ancient times!\" Mo Yi'er couldn't help but spin around in circles excitedly, her pink nightgown drew an arc, and then fell to her knees. The cartoon pattern Ahri on the nightgown seemed to be much happier. After the excitement, Mo Yi'er walked on the soft grass. She needed to find someone to confirm where she was, whether she had become a wealthy lady or a farm boy in the countryside! However, she soon discovered one thing, she was wearing it through her body, not her soul. This is difficult to handle. Without an identity, she can eat and drink whatever she wants? Are we still going to have to fend for ourselves like we did in our previous lives? In fact, there is nothing wrong with being self-reliant, but can you no longer be like an orphan, with no mother to love you, no father to love you? well! Mo Yi'er suddenly felt a little sad. The baby wearing clothes must have no relatives. \"Ah...Uh-huh! Ah...Uh-huh!\" The Tarzan-like roar from the movie sounded not far away. Mo Yi'er was slightly startled, and then what came into view was a huge pig! To be precise, it should be a wild boar! The wild boar was running towards Mo Yi'er crazily. It had a strong body and was as big as five or six adult men. It had a dark body, long hair, and dirty mud on it! Mo Yi'er was stunned on the spot and her mind went blank. \"Ah...Uh-huh! Ah...Uh-huh!\" The roar was getting closer and closer, and the wild boar's running speed was also soaring. Seeing that the wild boar's sharp fangs were about to pierce into Mo Yi'er's body, a man flew over, held Mo Yi'er in the air, and then landed on a big tree. The wind swept across her skin quickly, which brought Mo Yi'er back to her senses. She didn't see clearly the appearance of the person who saved her, because the person flew out again. Mo Yi'er's eyes began to light up: \"Oh my God, I just came across time and saw a master of Qing Kung Fu.\" However, just a second later, Mo Yi'er figured out why the person in front of him could fly. Rather than flying, it's better to say swinging. The distant black shadow held a long tree vine in its hand, swinging like Tarzan among the ancient trees that reached the sky. The target of the black shadow was the wild boar that almost killed Mo Yi'er. Mo Yi'er was very confused at the moment. Could it be that the man just now was an Orion? Hunting wild boars in the forest? After standing on the tree for a while, she felt a little tired, so she sat on the tree instead. The trees are very tall, and she is now about four or five meters high from the ground. Damn it! Idiots like Mo Yi'er, she just remembered that she couldn't climb trees. If the person who saved her just now didn't come back, how would she get down? \"Hey! Is there anyone there? Hello!\" Mo Yi'er waited for a while, and finally couldn't help shouting for help. \"Hey! Is there anyone? Someone come and save me!\" The only response she received was the sudden sound of wind. The person just now had wandered far away, and he couldn't even see his shadow. Only then did Mo Yi'er learn that there was a word called fear. Her previous excitement was completely diluted, and she began to consider her current situation. Not being able to climb trees is a challenge. If you accidentally fall, you will die or become disabled. If she didn't go down, she would starve to death. Even if she can go down safely, there must be other animals down there. The wild boar is so big. What if she encounters a wolf? What the hell is this place? Looking at the cartoon watch on her wrist, more than an hour had passed. Mo Yi'er became more and more restless. Finally, the Tarzan-like roar rang out again. \"Ah...Uh-huh! Ah...Uh-huh!\" Mo Yi'er quickly called for help: \"Hey! Help me, I can't get down!\" The man swung back from a distance, still carrying something on his body. When he got closer, Mo Yi'er realized that this was a bare-chested man with long hair draped over his shoulders and seemed to have a belt around his waist.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}